        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>文学作品知识摘录</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    background: #ededed;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 6px solid #b52c2d;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .inner-border {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 9px 10px 11px 10px;\n    border: 2px dashed #a92c2e;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 38px;\n    right: 37px;\n    bottom: 26px;\n    left: 43px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.58;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .intro {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #68417d;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.28;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .section-text {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin: 0 0 1px;\n  }\n\n  .work {\n    color: #138949;\n  }\n\n  .emphasis {\n    color: #c62d30;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .sun {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 3;\n    top: -8px;\n    left: -8px;\n    width: 39px;\n    height: 39px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #b52c2d;\n  }\n\n  .sun::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 11px;\n    left: 11px;\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f2c65d;\n  }\n\n  .sun-rays {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 4;\n    top: 2px;\n    left: 2px;\n    width: 25px;\n    height: 25px;\n    color: #f2c65d;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    line-height: 25px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .flower {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 4;\n    right: -2px;\n    bottom: -4px;\n    width: 32px;\n    height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #b52c2d;\n    color: #f2c65d;\n    font-family: serif;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 31px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .corner {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 15px;\n    height: 15px;\n    opacity: 0.45;\n  }\n\n  .corner.tl {\n    top: 21px;\n    left: 27px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #999;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n  }\n\n  .corner.tr {\n    top: 21px;\n    right: 27px;\n    border-left: 1px solid #999;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n  }\n\n  .corner.bl {\n    bottom: 21px;\n    left: 27px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #999;\n    border-top: 1px solid #999;\n  }\n\n  .corner.br {\n    right: 27px;\n    bottom: 21px;\n    border-left: 1px solid #999;\n    border-top: 1px solid #999;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 540px) {\n    body {\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      transform-origin: top left;\n      transform: scale(calc(100vw / 540));\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"inner-border\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sun\"><span class=\"sun-rays\">☀</span></div>\n    <div class=\"flower\">✿</div>\n    <span class=\"corner tl\"></span>\n    <span class=\"corner tr\"></span>\n    <span class=\"corner bl\"></span>\n    <span class=\"corner br\"></span>\n\n    <article class=\"content\">\n      <p class=\"intro\">艾青的诗歌《绿》运用文字的魅力用文学的形式描述了<span class=\"emphasis\">春天到处都是绿色</span>，树木大地中的小草在春风的春拂下来回摆动，<span class=\"emphasis\">风是绿的，水是绿的，世界充满了绿</span>。绿是<span class=\"emphasis\">生命</span>的颜色，是<span class=\"emphasis\">生命</span>的象征。</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">11.白桦</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-text\"><span class=\"work\">《白桦》</span>诗歌以白桦为中心意象，从不同角度描写它的美。白桦那么<span class=\"emphasis\">高洁、挺拔</span>，它是<span class=\"emphasis\">高尚人格</span>的象征。</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">12.在天晴了的时候</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-text\"><span class=\"work\">《在天晴了的时候》</span>这是一首生动、活泼、情趣盎然的小诗，诗人以清新、优美的语言，运用<span class=\"emphasis\">拟人</span>的手法、形象的比喻勾勒出一幅幅充满生机的画面，展现了<span class=\"emphasis\">雨后天地间的亲切、自然、欢乐和美好</span>，抒发了<span class=\"emphasis\">亲近自然、热爱生活的情怀</span>。</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">13.猫</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-text\"><span class=\"work\">《猫》</span>一文是著名作家<span class=\"emphasis\">老舍</span>的作品，作者通过对猫的<span class=\"emphasis\">古怪性格</span>和<span class=\"emphasis\">满月小猫</span>特点的描写，抒发了对<span class=\"emphasis\">猫的喜爱之情</span>。</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">14.母鸡</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-text\"><span class=\"work\">《母鸡》</span>一文是<span class=\"emphasis\">老舍</span>先生脍炙人口的佳作，描写了作者对母鸡的看法的变化，表达了作者对<span class=\"emphasis\">母爱的赞颂之情</span>。课文以<span class=\"emphasis\">作者的情感变化为线索</span>，前后形成了<span class=\"emphasis\">鲜明</span>的对比。前半部分写了母鸡的<span class=\"emphasis\">无病，欺软怕硬，拼命炫耀</span>，后半部分写了母鸡的<span class=\"emphasis\">负责、慈爱、勇敢、辛苦</span>，塑造了一位“<span class=\"emphasis\">伟大的鸡母亲</span>”的形象。</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">15.白鹅</h2>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
